---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Shipping Policy | Fresh Petals Hyderabad"
  description="Fresh Petals Hyderabad shipping and delivery policy for bouquets, pooja flowers, jasmine, garlands, flower boxes, subscriptions and bulk orders."
>
  <main class="bg-white">
    <section class="px-5 py-12 md:px-8 md:py-16">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
        <div class="mb-10 text-center">
          <p class="text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.32em] text-[#9B6B78]">
            Fresh Petals Hyderabad
          </p>

          <h1 class="fp-serif mt-3 text-3xl uppercase tracking-[0.20em] text-[#171717] md:text-5xl">
            Shipping Policy
          </h1>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-5 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D] md:text-base">
            Delivery information for fresh flowers, pooja flowers, jasmine, bouquets, garlands, flower boxes and bulk orders across selected Hyderabad areas.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="space-y-5">
          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Delivery Areas
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Fresh Petals currently delivers to selected areas in Hyderabad based on pincode, distance, product type, order value and delivery timing. If your pincode is not listed as confirmed during checkout, you can still continue on WhatsApp and we will manually check delivery feasibility.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Delivery Charges
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Delivery charges depend on the delivery pincode, distance, order size and time slot. The website may show an estimated delivery fee for supported pincodes. Final delivery charges will be confirmed on WhatsApp before payment.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Delivery Slots
            </h2>

            <div class="mt-4 space-y-3 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              <p>Available delivery slots may include:</p>

              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li>• Morning Slot: 7 AM - 10 AM</li>
                <li>• Afternoon Slot: 12 PM - 3 PM</li>
                <li>• Evening Slot: 5 PM - 8 PM</li>
                <li>• Express Delivery: Within 4-6 hours, subject to availability</li>
              </ul>

              <p>
                Morning and express delivery may not be available in all areas. Final slot confirmation will happen on WhatsApp.
              </p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Same-Day Delivery
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Same-day delivery depends on flower availability, order time, delivery area and order complexity. Bouquets and simple flower orders may be easier to fulfill on the same day, while garlands, poola jada, bulk flowers and event orders may require advance notice.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Pooja Flowers, Jasmine and Garlands
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Pooja flowers, jasmine/malli, gajra, garlands and poola jada are highly dependent on morning market availability. For these products, we recommend placing orders early or confirming in advance on WhatsApp.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Bulk and Event Orders
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Bulk flower orders, temple orders, event flowers, garlands and wedding-related orders require manual confirmation. Delivery cost, handling charges and timing will be shared after understanding the quantity, location and requirement.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Failed Delivery or Customer Unavailable
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              Since flowers are perishable, customers are requested to be available at the delivery address during the selected time slot. If the customer is unavailable or the address is incorrect, redelivery may be chargeable or may not be possible depending on flower condition and delivery route.
            </p>
          </section>

          <section class="rounded-[24px] border border-[#EEE5E8] bg-white p-6 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(40,24,32,0.05)]">
            <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
              Final Confirmation
            </h2>

            <p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
              All orders are confirmed only after WhatsApp confirmation of flower availability, delivery area, delivery fee, time slot and payment details.
            </p>
          </section>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-10 rounded-[24px] border border-[#E8D8DE] bg-[#FFF8FA] p-6 text-center">
          <h2 class="text-[12px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-[#171717]">
            Need delivery confirmation?
          </h2>

          <p class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-2xl text-sm leading-7 text-[#66565D]">
            Share your pincode, delivery date and flower requirement on WhatsApp.
          </p>

          <a
            href="https://wa.me/919652012274?text=Hi%20Fresh%20Petals%2C%20I%20want%20to%20check%20delivery%20availability%20for%20my%20pincode."
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="mt-6 inline-flex rounded-full bg-[#075838] px-7 py-4 text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-white transition hover:bg-[#7C243E]"
          >
            Check on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>